{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012Q65aUebnxZ9EnvDh82Mt6","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\ttitle: \"Feature Specification: Offer the right deep-loop command and flags from explicit loop wording\"\n3\tdescription: \"A request that asks for a deep loop in plain words gets no command row, while a depth-only request can get one it never asked for. After a yes, nothing tells the AI which suffix or flags to use. This packet makes explicit loop wording open the command gate and teaches the offer, the flags and the setup.\"\n4\ttrigger_phrases:\n5\t  - \"deep loop command offers\"\n6\t  - \"offer the right deep loop command and flags\"\n7\timportance_tier: \"normal\"\n8\tcontextType: \"general\"\n9\t---\n10\t<!-- SPECKIT_TEMPLATE_SOURCE: spec-core | v2.4 -->\n11\t# Feature Specification: Offer the right deep-loop command and flags from explicit loop wording\n12\t\n13\t<!-- SPECKIT_LEVEL: 2 -->\n14\t---\n15\t\n16\t<!-- ANCHOR:metadata -->\n17\t## 1. METADATA\n18\t\n19\t| Field | Value |\n20\t|-------|-------|\n21\t| **Level** | 2 |\n22\t| **Priority** | P1 |\n23\t| **Status** | Complete |\n24\t| **Created** | 2026-11-22 |\n25\t| **Branch** | `worktrees/516-deep-loop-command-offers` |\n26\t<!-- /ANCHOR:metadata -->\n27\t\n28\t---\n29\t\n30\t<!-- ANCHOR:problem -->\n31\t## 2. PROBLEM & PURPOSE\n32\t\n33\t### Problem Statement\n34\tThe advisor attaches `/deep:research` or `/deep:review` only when a prompt carries depth wording, so a request that asks for the loop in plain words gets no command row. In the block below, V6, H1a, H1b, E1 and E3 all ask for a loop or for iterations and all print `cmd=-`. A request that only asks for effort gets a command it did not ask for. R7 (\"find out everything you can\") prints `cmd=/deep:research pol=ask`. When a row is offered, no document says what the one question holds, which suffix follows a yes or which flags fit. The setup form after a yes is a typed-letter menu with no recommended option. A finished or stuck run halts with a message that names neither `--extend` nor `/doctor:deep-loop`.\n35\t\n36\t### Purpose\n37\tA deep-loop command is offered when, and only when, the request asks for the loop itself. The offer is one question whose recommended option runs `:auto` with flags composed from the request.\n38\t\n39\t### Decision this packet follows\n40\tThe operator's decision of 2026-11-22 (`scratch/decisions.md`, row D2) narrows the gate to explicit loop asks. It supersedes the rule in `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/decision-record.md` (line 44, \"a deep loop is offered only when the prompt uses depth wording\"). A reader of that packet should treat its depth-wording rule as replaced by this one.\n41\t\n42\tAn explicit loop ask is any of these:\n43\t- It names a deep loop, deep research, deep review, a research loop or a review loop.\n44\t- It gives an iteration count, or says \"iterations\", \"iterative\" or \"iteratively\".\n45\t- It says multi-pass, or multiple, several or many passes.\n46\t- It types a `/deep:*` command.\n47\t- It asks to continue, resume or extend a deep run.\n48\t\n49\tDepth words alone are not a loop ask: thorough, thoroughly, in depth, exhaustive, deep dive, everything you can, final verdict. The council words are not one either: ask the council, convene, several models.\n50\t<!-- /ANCHOR:problem -->\n51\t\n52\t<!-- ANCHOR:measured-behavior -->\n53\t### Measured Behavior\n54\t\n55\tRun from the repository root on 2026-11-22. `git status --short .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor` printed nothing before and after the run, so this is the advisor as committed at `2ef3895f753`. The probe file holds 69 prompts taken from the routing analysis, grouped by what this packet expects of each. Every one exited 0 with `live` freshness.\n56\t\n57\t```text\n58\t$ node specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/012-deep-loop-command-offers/scratch/probes/probe.mjs specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/012-deep-loop-command-offers/scratch/probes/probes-spec-baseline.json specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/012-deep-loop-command-offers/scratch/probes/results-spec-baseline.json\n59\tV6 [exit 0 live] n=3 amb=false | system-deep-loop c=0.9471 u=0.12 route/single/review cmd=- pol=- kind=skill || 2: sk-code c=0.82 cmd=- pol=- || 3: system-spec-kit c=0.82\n60\tH1a [exit 0 live] n=3 amb=true | system-deep-loop c=0.95 u=0.16 route/single/review cmd=- pol=- kind=skill || 2: sk-doc c=0.9449 cmd=- pol=- || 3: sk-code c=0.9316\n61\tH1b [exit 0 live] n=3 amb=false | system-deep-loop c=0.9008 u=0.12 route/single/research cmd=- pol=- kind=skill || 2: system-spec-kit c=0.82 cmd=- pol=- || 3: mcp-tooling c=0.82\n62\tE1 [exit 0 live] n=3 amb=true | system-deep-loop c=0.82 u=0.2 defer/-/- cmd=- pol=- kind=skill FLOORED || 2: cli-external-orchestration c=0.819 cmd=- pol=- || 3: sk-code c=0.82\n63\tE3 [exit 0 live] n=3 amb=true | system-deep-loop c=0.8756 u=0.16 defer/-/- cmd=- pol=- kind=skill || 2: cli-external-orchestration c=0.8746 cmd=- pol=- || 3: sk-code c=0.8651\n64\tR2 [exit 0 live] n=1 amb=false | system-spec-kit c=0.82 u=0.18 -/-/- cmd=- pol=- kind=skill FLOORED\n65\tV2 [exit 0 live] n=3 amb=false | sk-code c=0.95 u=0.12 route/single/sk-code-review cmd=- pol=- kind=skill || 2: sk-git c=0.8435 cmd=- pol=- || 3: system-deep-loop c=0.82\n66\tV4 [exit 0 live] n=1 amb=false | sk-code c=0.82 u=0.16 route/single/sk-code-review cmd=- pol=- kind=skill FLOORED\n67\tH7 [exit 0 live] n=0 amb=false | NONE\n68\tH10 [exit 0 live] n=1 amb=false | sk-code c=0.82 u=0.16 route/single/sk-code-review cmd=- pol=- kind=skill FLOORED\n69\tR7 [exit 0 live] n=2 amb=true | system-deep-loop c=0.8545 u=0.16 route/single/research cmd=/deep:research pol=ask kind=skill || 2: sk-code c=0.8349 cmd=- pol=-\n70\tN9 [exit 0 live] n=3 amb=false | system-deep-loop c=0.9073 u=0.12 route/single/research cmd=/deep:research pol=ask kind=skill || 2: cli-external-orchestration c=0.82