ne that a refusal leads or follows, or that names the request's\n    subject. The Python fallback carries the same rules and now reads a typed\n    command with the TypeScript boundary and mention checks.\n    \n    A typed deep-loop command now carries a typed flag through the recommend\n    output, so the brief prints plain (ask) instead of offering a mode the\n    reader already chose. The routing baseline was recaptured because one\n    refused holdout row stopped carrying a command.\n    \n    Spec: system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/012-deep-loop-command-offers\n    Spec: system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/013-deep-loop-offer-in-hint\n    Commit-Id: 0015965\n\ndiff --git a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/lib/skill-advisor-cli-fallback.ts b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/lib/skill-advisor-cli-fallback.ts\nindex f69351dac84..745f4492a84 100644\n--- a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/lib/skill-advisor-cli-fallback.ts\n+++ b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/lib/skill-advisor-cli-fallback.ts\n@@ -390,6 +390,9 @@ function recommendationFromCli(value: unknown, thresholds: { readonly confidence\n     // A hub that held back its command for want of a mode keeps that signal, so\n     // the head can say why no command came with it.\n     ...(value.needsMode === true ? { needsMode: true } : {}),\n+    // A command the reader typed already carries their choice of mode, so the\n+    // head must know it was typed to leave the offer options off.\n+    ...(value.typed === true ? { typed: true as const } : {}),\n     // A floored route is held back against the session's earlier route, so the\n     // floor has to survive the trip from the CLI.\n     ...(value.confidenceFloored === true ? { confidenceFloored: true as const } : {}),","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01FxyB3LoN8QB14rXJ338KXZ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config"