{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JuTJEX2ti2UmtRz27pgziL","type":"tool_result","content":"32:- It offers a deep loop only when you ask for one, and not when you turn one down with words such as \"don't\", \"never\" or \"no need to\".\n73:> 19. Depth words such as \"thorough\" no longer offer a deep loop. [Only loop asks](#c-only-loop-asks-bring-a-deep-command)\n91:- The advisor offered a loop on depth words and missed most plain loop asks.\n107:| [The advisor offers the loop with its flags](#c-the-advisor-offers-the-loop-with-its-flags) | One question runs `:auto` with flags composed from your request. | Deep Loop |\n203:#### The Advisor Offers the Loop With Its Flags <a id=\"c-the-advisor-offers-the-loop-with-its-flags\"></a>\n213:- A deep command you typed shows plain `(ask)` with no options, because you already picked the mode.\n214:- A live offer read `A) Run it (Recommended): /deep:review:auto \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\" --max-iterations=5 --stop-policy=max-iterations`.\n219:- Its next steps offer an extension and `/doctor:deep-loop`.\n470:> Depth words such as \"thorough\" or \"in depth\" no longer offer a deep loop. Name an iteration count, a loop or several passes to get one.\n478:- A typed `/deep:*` command still counts.\n483:- A turned-down loop gets no run, as in \"no need to run a deep review\" or \"a deep review is not needed\".\n490:- A bare \"iterations\" that names past runs offers no loop, as in \"audit the first two iterations\".\n706:Each fix landed with its own suite run. Most numbers come from commit records and the skill changelogs. The advisor, doctor and residue rows come from one run on the merged tree. The deep-loop suite row comes from one run on the merged tree too. A live round on DeepSeek and Claude also ran the new deep-loop paths. The blocked stop never came up live, so only its tests cover it. A live Claude session opened the loop offer in the question tool. Two advisor checks are still short of their marks. The folded blocks hold the costs and the full test results.\n727:| A deep review that keeps running and never converges | a new review offered | `/doctor:deep-loop` |\n728:| `summarize the research.md from the last deep research run` | a new research run offered | no offer |","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<redacted>","uuid":"<redacted>","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:53:05.555Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"32:- It offers a deep loop only when you ask for one, and not when you turn one down with words such as \"don't\", \"never\" or \"no need to\".\n73:> 19. Depth words such as \"thorough\" no longer offer a deep loop. [Only loop asks](#c-only-loop-asks-bring-a-deep-command)\n91:- The advisor offered a loop on depth words and missed most plain loop asks.\n107:| [The advisor offers the loop with its flags](#c-the-advisor-offers-the-loop-with-its-flags) | One question runs `:auto` with flags composed from your request. | Deep Loop |\n203:#### The Advisor Offers the Loop With Its Flags <a id=\"c-the-advisor-offers-the-loop-with-its-flags\"></a>\n213:- A deep command you typed shows plain `(ask)` with no options, because you already picked the mode.\n214:- A live offer read `A) Run it (Recommended): /deep:review:auto \".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime\" --max-iterations=5 --stop-policy=max-iterations`.\n219:- Its next steps offer an extension and `/doctor:deep-loop`.\n470:> Depth words such as \"thorough\" or \"in depth\" no longer offer a deep loop. Name an iteration count, a loop or several passes to get one.\n478:- A typed `/deep:*` command still counts.\n483:- A turned-down loop gets no run, as in \"no need to run a deep review\" or \"a deep review is not needed\".\n490:- A bare \"iterations\" that names past runs offers no loop, as in \"audit the first two iterations\".\n706:Each fix landed with its own suite run. Most numbers come from commit records and the skill changelogs. The advisor, doctor and residue rows come from one run on the merged tree. The deep-loop suite row comes from one run on the merged tree too. A live round on DeepSeek and Claude also ran the new deep-loop paths. The blocked stop never came up live, so only its tests cover it. A live Claude session opened the loop offer in the question tool. Two advisor checks are still short of their marks. The folded blocks hold the costs and the full test results.\n727:| A deep review that keeps running and never converges | a new review offered | `/doctor:deep-loop` |\n728:| `summarize the research.md from the last deep research run` | a new research run offered | no offer |","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01JuTJEX2ti2UmtRz27pgziL","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
